# Deterministic Latch-9 caches rebuilt by RustlineLatch9MuzzleSetup.
# The flash sprites are loaded by path in the current Editor harness, so no versioned asset
# stores their generated sprite GUIDs yet. Remove these ignores when persistent prefab refs land.
/Assets/Art/Effects/Weapons/latch_9/latch_9_muzzle_flash.png.meta
/Assets/Art/Effects/Weapons/latch_9/latch_9_muzzle_flash_bouncing.png.meta
/Assets/Resources.meta
/Assets/Resources/Generated/

